></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGAHATA, TAKAYA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ROHM CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAGAHATA TAKAYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGAHATA, TAKAYA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A thermal print head comprises a plurality of heater elements (6) to which head voltage is applied to produce heat for printing paper, and a plurality of drive ICs (3) for supplying logic voltage to drive the heater elements (6). The printing is performed at the head voltage between 2.7 and 8.5 V. The drive ICs (3) may operate at the logic voltage between 2.7 and 5.5 V.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur une tête d'impression thermique comportant plusieurs éléments chauffants (6) auxquels on applique une tension de tête pour produire la chaleur nécessaire à l'impression du papier, et une série de CIs (3) de commande fournissant les tension de la logique alimentant les éléments chauffants (6). L'impression s'effectue à des tension de tête comprises entre 2,7 et 8,5 V, tandis que les CIs (3) de commande fonctionnent sous des tensions d'alimentation des logiques comprises entre 2,7 et 5,5 V.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth 